            "model_sha256": "fa2494dab670a698a8f730a0501c997984467839906f5c7b702e50ad6fd61261",
            "quote": "From 1975 to 1984, numerous episodes of rifting (surface cracking) took place along the Krafla fissure zone.",
            "source_id": "usgs-divergent-plate-boundaries-1996",
            "source_sha256": "a9539d135ff1577d7e2791d498b92f55239175565b925b24aec2ed0bf633f186",
