        "classification": "SUPPORTED_GROUPING_ONLY",
        "definition": "A nebula is a cloud of gas and dust in space, and nebulae is the plural term.",
        "definition_evidence": [
          {
            "document_id": "text-c0cb2519673b8f3e",
            "end_char": 477,
            "model_path": "examples/evaluations/spec-052-candidate-b-v2-live-evaluation-20260915/sources/04-nasa-solar-system-formation-2026/admitted-knowledge-model.json",
            "model_sha256": "d0a28afecf69d8edc55783eb41b4de78c72d81ef6007ac8121a003946b06b198",
            "quote": "We call such a cloud a “nebula” and more than one of them we refer to as “nebulae.”",
            "source_id": "nasa-solar-system-formation-2026",
            "source_sha256": "c0cb2519673b8f3ef23c0be2856e03790f53d44971cbff09d593190ab3fa155d",
            "start_char": 394
          },
          {
            "document_id": "text-c0cb2519673b8f3e",
            "end_char": 686,
            "model_path": "examples/evaluations/spec-052-candidate-b-v2-live-evaluation-20260915/sources/04-nasa-solar-system-formation-2026/admitted-knowledge-model.json",
            "model_sha256": "d0a28afecf69d8edc55783eb41b4de78c72d81ef6007ac8121a003946b06b198",
            "quote": "Nebulae are massive clouds of dust and debris in space and have all the ingredients to form stars and planets.",
            "source_id": "nasa-solar-system-formation-2026",
            "source_sha256": "c0cb2519673b8f3ef23c0be2856e03790f53d44971cbff09d593190ab3fa155d",
            "start_char": 576
          },
          {
            "document_id": "text-c0cb2519673b8f3e",
            "end_char": 575,
            "model_path": "examples/evaluations/spec-052-candidate-b-v2-live-evaluation-20260915/sources/04-nasa-solar-system-formation-2026/admitted-knowledge-model.json",
            "model_sha256": "d0a28afecf69d8edc55783eb41b4de78c72d81ef6007ac8121a003946b06b198",
            "quote": "There are nebulae all around our galaxy, and it’s from these nebulae that stars and planets form.",
            "source_id": "nasa-solar-system-formation-2026",
            "source_sha256": "c0cb2519673b8f3ef23c0be2856e03790f53d44971cbff09d593190ab3fa155d",
            "start_char": 478
          },
          {
            "document_id": "text-c0cb2519673b8f3e",
